      "statement": "**Payments:** apply current PCI DSS requirements to the actual cardholder-data environment and minimize scope through tokenization or hosted collection where suitable. PCI DSS v4.0.1 is the current published revision in the PCI SSC document library. ([pcisecuritystandards.org](https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/document_library/))",
