      "statement": "**Children:** determine whether the product is directed to children or has actual knowledge of child users and apply parental-consent, minimization, advertising, safety, and deletion requirements. ([ftc.gov](https://www.ftc.gov/legal-library/browse/rules/childrens-online-privacy-protection-rule-coppa))",
